WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.624 --> 00:00:06.990
After Tom and Lord Hertford returned to the prince's room, some orders from King Henry arrived.

2
00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:14.277
Lord Hertford read the document before explaining it to Tom.

3
00:00:27.836 --> 00:00:33.100
"Until you are well again, you must hide your illness," Lord Hertford said.

4
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:37.843
"You must stop denying that you are Prince Edward.

5
00:00:40.185 --> 00:00:45.008
And you must stop talking about your family and home on Offal Street.

6
00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:49.051
They exist only in your imagination."

7
00:00:53.214 --> 00:00:55.216
Lord Hertford rolled up the document.

8
00:00:56.692 --> 00:01:01.493
"If you don't recognize someone or remember how to act, ask me for help."

9
00:01:01.513 --> 00:01:07.315
"If those are the king's orders, I must obey."

10
00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:13.517
Tom sighed and then looked at Lord Hertford curiously.

11
00:01:13.537 --> 00:01:17.098
"Why aren't you sitting down?"

12
00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:23.040
"No one sits without your permission," Lord Hertford said.

13
00:01:26.364 --> 00:01:29.866
At that moment Princess Elizabeth and Lady Jane were announced.

14
00:01:33.428 --> 00:01:40.432
As the girls passed Lord Hertford, he whispered, "Don't act surprised if the prince behaves strangely."

15
00:01:45.135 --> 00:01:49.017
The girls giggled and exchanged looks before they curtsied to Tom.

16
00:01:50.898 --> 00:01:54.560
Despite Lord Hertford's warning, the conversation was awkward.

17
00:01:58.508 --> 00:02:00.189
"Have you seen the queen today?"

18
00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:04.192
Princess Elizabeth asked Tom, after he invited them to sit.

19
00:02:04.212 --> 00:02:10.276
"The queen Tom squeezed his eyes shut.

20
00:02:11.577 --> 00:02:14.679
He couldn't think of anything that Prince Edward had said about his mother.

21
00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.941
Suddenly he remembered why.

22
00:02:17.961 --> 00:02:21.443
"That's because he didn't mention her!"

23
00:02:21.784 --> 00:02:22.704
Tom said aloud.

24
00:02:22.724 --> 00:02:26.447
"Excuse me?"

25
00:02:26.867 --> 00:02:28.128
Princess Elizabeth said.

26
00:02:30.444 --> 00:02:34.448
Tom looked at Lord Hertford for help, but his adviser merely groaned.

27
00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:41.575
"I mean that I haven't seen the queen yet."

28
00:02:43.356 --> 00:02:45.418
Tom fidgeted with the handle of his sword.

29
00:02:45.438 --> 00:02:50.103
"But I did speak to the king, and he didn't mention her!"

30
00:02:53.025 --> 00:02:55.508
Princess Elizabeth seemed satisfied with that answer.

31
00:02:57.516 --> 00:03:01.720
Tom flashed Lord Hertford a triumphant grin, and his adviser smiled weakly.

32
00:03:03.021 --> 00:03:06.924
Lord Hertford decided to move the conversation away from the royal family.

33
00:03:06.944 --> 00:03:13.670
"The king has declared that the prince should take a break from studying," he said.

34
00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:19.115
"That's a shame, but don't worry," Lady Jane said.

35
00:03:19.135 --> 00:03:23.098
"One day you'll be as wise as your father."

36
00:03:23.118 --> 00:03:27.197
"Wise? He's an ignorant swine!"

37
00:03:29.759 --> 00:03:32.461
Tom scowled, thinking of his real father.

38
00:03:35.203 --> 00:03:38.925
Then seeing the horror in everyone's eyes, he tried to recover.

39
00:03:38.945 --> 00:03:48.091
"Um well what I meant was Lord Hertford shook his head sadly.

40
00:03:48.111 --> 00:03:51.493
"I didn't mean to insult the king!"

41
00:03:51.974 --> 00:03:52.834
Tom blurted out.

42
00:03:52.854 --> 00:03:55.256
"I'm not feeling well."

43
00:03:58.324 --> 00:03:59.245
"We know that."

44
00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:01.587
Princess Elizabeth smiled politely.

45
00:04:01.607 --> 00:04:05.290
"You're not quite yourself today."

46
00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:08.452
"That's for sure!"

47
00:04:08.913 --> 00:04:11.135
Tom thought, but he didn't say that aloud.

48
00:04:12.095 --> 00:04:17.540
Instead he said, "Thank you, dear sister, for being so kind and understanding."

49
00:04:19.361 --> 00:04:22.184
For a few minutes, the conversation proceeded smoothly.

50
00:04:24.085 --> 00:04:27.208
But then Lady Jane said something to Tom in Greek.

51
00:04:30.632 --> 00:04:32.553
"I have no idea what you just said."

52
00:04:33.694 --> 00:04:35.395
Tom felt his panic rise again.

53
00:04:35.415 --> 00:04:38.197
"I'm not sure that I can do this anymore.

54
00:04:39.437 --> 00:04:49.943
You see, I shouldn't even be here because I'm really Tom—" Lord Hertford coughed loudly, and Tom realized

55
00:04:50.004 --> 00:04:51.024
he should stop talking.

56
00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:57.228
Lord Hertford pulled out a handkerchief and wiped some sweat from his face.

57
00:04:58.404 --> 00:05:00.446
He needed to put an end to this visit.

58
00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:05.770
"My dear ladies," Lord Hertford said.

59
00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:10.875
"I hope you'll excuse His Highness because it's time for him to rest.

60
00:05:12.156 --> 00:05:15.458
The king doesn't want him to be tired for the banquet tonight."

61
00:05:15.478 --> 00:05:19.782
"Banquet?" Tom's eyes opened wide.

62
00:05:19.802 --> 00:05:21.904
"What banquet?"

63
00:05:24.192 --> 00:05:29.617
"You promised the king two weeks ago that you'd attend the mayor's banquet," Lord Hertford said.

64
00:05:29.637 --> 00:05:33.360
"Oh, that banquet!"

65
00:05:34.561 --> 00:05:38.103
Tom smacked his forehead with his hand, pretending that he'd forgotten.

66
00:05:38.123 --> 00:05:40.705
"Yes, I must rest."

67
00:05:44.509 --> 00:05:48.011
The girls stared at Tom, waiting for him to give them permission to go.

68
00:05:49.393 --> 00:05:53.396
Finally Princess Elizabeth said, "May we leave, Your Highness?"

69
00:05:54.920 --> 00:06:00.665
"Yes." Then Tom remembered the way that princes spoke in Father Andrew's stories.

70
00:06:00.685 --> 00:06:03.127
"You are dismissed.

71
00:06:04.408 --> 00:06:05.950
May you have a good journey."

72
00:06:10.414 --> 00:06:11.234
good journey?"

73
00:06:11.675 --> 00:06:13.837
Jane whispered as the girls headed for the door.

74
00:06:13.857 --> 00:06:19.722
"He obviously has forgotten that we live here too," Elizabeth whispered back.

75
00:06:25.624 --> 00:06:29.526
Tired from pretending to be a prince, Tom turned to Lord Hertford.

76
00:06:29.546 --> 00:06:32.767
"I really would like to rest now.

77
00:06:34.008 --> 00:06:34.768
You may leave."

78
00:06:36.189 --> 00:06:38.109
Lord Hertford bowed and left the room.

79
00:06:42.011 --> 00:06:45.012
But as soon as Tom flopped on the bed, a servant appeared.

80
00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:51.215
no, Your Highness," the servant said gently.

81
00:06:51.235 --> 00:06:54.156
"You can't sleep in those clothes."

82
00:06:56.312 --> 00:06:59.454
Tom started to pull off his shoes, but the servant stopped him.

83
00:06:59.474 --> 00:07:01.955
"That's my job, sir."

84
00:07:05.037 --> 00:07:09.079
A few minutes later, Tom was wrapped in a silk robe, but he couldn't sleep.

85
00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.822
When he opened his eyes, the servant was still standing by the door.

86
00:07:14.842 --> 00:07:18.204
"What are you doing here?"

87
00:07:20.685 --> 00:07:21.446
Tom moaned.

88
00:07:21.466 --> 00:07:27.707
"Waiting for you to dismiss me, Your Highness," the servant said with a smile.
